# Search index for Pyro

Pyro Search Notes loads **one** file: `search-index.json`. It does not fetch every markdown at runtime.

When you add or edit a note (or regenerate `notes-index.json`), run:

```bash
node scripts/build-search-index.mjs
```

Commit `search-index.json` with the notes. Do not skip this on existing-file edits.
